# Raw camera exports that live in public/images for local reference only. They are
# already git-ignored, so Git deploys never see them — this guards against a
# `vercel` CLI deploy uploading ~500MB of source footage.
#
# Do NOT add the poster originals here (alacarte-poster.jpg, hero-poster-mobile.png,
# etc). `npm run build` runs optimize-posters, which needs them as inputs to
# generate the responsive WebP variants the site actually serves.
public/images/wetransfer_ullishtja/
*.mov
*.MOV
*.heic
*.HEIC

# Local dev/server artifacts that are not part of the static deployment
uploads/
build/
